{"seq":3,"slug":"kriging-and-interpolation","title":"克里金与空间插值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/kriging-and-interpolation","wordCount":1294,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"克里金与空间插值\">克里金与空间插值</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间插值（Spatial Interpolation）利用已知采样点的值估算未采样位置的值。克里金（Kriging）是最经典的地统计插值方法，它不仅给出最优预测值，还提供预测不确定性的估计。克里金的核心思想是利用空间自相关结构（通过变异函数描述）来确定最优的加权组合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[空间插值方法] --&gt; B[确定性方法]&#10;    A --&gt; C[地统计方法]&#10;    B --&gt; D[IDW 反距离加权]&#10;    B --&gt; E[样条插值]&#10;    C --&gt; F[普通克里金]&#10;    C --&gt; G[泛克里金]&#10;    C --&gt; H[协克里金]&#10;    A --&gt; I[变异函数分析]&#10;    I --&gt; J[球面模型]&#10;    I --&gt; K[指数模型]&#10;    I --&gt; L[高斯模型]\">graph TD\n    A[空间插值方法] --&gt; B[确定性方法]\n    A --&gt; C[地统计方法]\n    B --&gt; D[IDW 反距离加权]\n    B --&gt; E[样条插值]\n    C --&gt; F[普通克里金]\n    C --&gt; G[泛克里金]\n    C --&gt; H[协克里金]\n    A --&gt; I[变异函数分析]\n    I --&gt; J[球面模型]\n    I --&gt; K[指数模型]\n    I --&gt; L[高斯模型]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插值方法</th>\n<th>不确定性估计</th>\n<th>各向异性</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>计算复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IDW</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>快速估算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样条</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>平滑表面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通克里金</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>环境监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛克里金</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>有趋势数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协克里金</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>多变量协同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变异函数分析\">变异函数分析</h2><p>变异函数（Variogram）描述空间自相关随距离变化的规律，是克里金的理论基石。实验变异函数通过计算所有点对的半方差来估计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from pykrige.ok import OrdinaryKriging&#10;&#10;def experimental_variogram(coords, values, n_lags=15):&#10;    n = len(values)&#10;    pairs = []&#10;    for i in range(n):&#10;        for j in range(i + 1, n):&#10;            dist = np.sqrt((coords[i, 0] - coords[j, 0])**2 +&#10;                          (coords[i, 1] - coords[j, 1])**2)&#10;            gamma = 0.5 * (values[i] - values[j])**2&#10;            pairs.append((dist, gamma))&#10;&#10;    pairs = np.array(pairs)&#10;    max_dist = pairs[:, 0].max() / 2&#10;    lag_edges = np.linspace(0, max_dist, n_lags + 1)&#10;&#10;    lags, semivariances = [], []&#10;    for k in range(n_lags):&#10;        mask = (pairs[:, 0] &gt;= lag_edges[k]) &amp; (pairs[:, 0] &lt; lag_edges[k + 1])&#10;        if mask.sum() &gt; 0:&#10;            lags.append((lag_edges[k] + lag_edges[k + 1]) / 2)&#10;            semivariances.append(pairs[mask, 1].mean())&#10;    return np.array(lags), np.array(semivariances)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pykrige.ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrdinaryKriging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> experimental_variogram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(coords, values, n_lags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pairs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt((coords[i, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coords[j, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                          (coords[i, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coords[j, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            gamma </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (values[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values[j])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            pairs.append((dist, gamma))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pairs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array(pairs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairs[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].max() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lag_edges </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linspace(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max_dist, n_lags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lags, semivariances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_lags):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pairs[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag_edges[k]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pairs[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag_edges[k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask.sum() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            lags.append((lag_edges[k] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag_edges[k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            semivariances.append(pairs[mask, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].mean())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array(lags), np.array(semivariances)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>变异函数的三个关键参数决定了空间自相关的结构特征：</p>\n<p><strong>块金效应（Nugget）</strong>：变异函数在距离趋近于零时的截距，反映微尺度随机变异和测量误差。块金值越大，短距离内数据点之间的相关性越低。</p>\n<p><strong>偏基台（Partial Sill）</strong>：变异函数从块金值增长到基台值的增量，反映空间结构性变异的幅度。偏基台与块金之和为基台（Sill）。</p>\n<p><strong>变程（Range）</strong>：变异函数达到基台时的距离，超过变程的点对之间不再存在空间自相关。变程决定了空间插值的有效影响范围。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变异函数模型</th>\n<th>公式特征</th>\n<th>适用情况</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>球面</td>\n<td>线性增长后趋平</td>\n<td>最常用</td>\n<td>块金、偏基台、变程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数</td>\n<td>指数趋近基台</td>\n<td>连续渐变</td>\n<td>块金、偏基台、变程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高斯</td>\n<td>S 形曲线</td>\n<td>极平滑</td>\n<td>块金、偏基台、变程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>线性增长</td>\n<td>无限变程</td>\n<td>块金、斜率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模型选择应基于实验变异函数的形态：如果半方差在短距离内快速增长然后趋平，球面模型适合；如果增长更平缓且渐近趋近基台，指数模型适合；如果半方差在零距离附近增长非常缓慢（近似抛物线形），高斯模型适合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"普通克里金\">普通克里金</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pykrige.ok import OrdinaryKriging&#10;&#10;ok = OrdinaryKriging(&#10;    x, y, values,&#10;    variogram_model=&#39;spherical&#39;,&#10;    verbose=False,&#10;    enable_plotting=False,&#10;)&#10;&#10;grid_x = np.linspace(x.min(), x.max(), 100)&#10;grid_y = np.linspace(y.min(), y.max(), 100)&#10;&#10;z_pred, z_var = ok.execute(&#39;grid&#39;, grid_x, grid_y)&#10;z_std = np.sqrt(z_var)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pykrige.ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrdinaryKriging</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrdinaryKriging(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x, y, values,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    variogram_model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spherical'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    verbose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    enable_plotting</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid_x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linspace(x.min(), x.max(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grid_y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linspace(y.min(), y.max(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z_pred, z_var </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ok.execute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'grid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, grid_x, grid_y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z_std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(z_var)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>普通克里金假设区域化变量的均值未知但恒定，通过构建克里金方程组求解最优权重，使预测方差最小化且满足无偏约束。克里金方差不依赖于观测值本身——只取决于点的空间分布和变异函数参数，这意味着即使不知道实际观测值也能评估采样设计的质量。</p>\n<p>泛克里金（Universal Kriging）放松了均值恒定的假设，允许均值随空间位置呈多项式趋势变化。适用于存在明显空间趋势的数据，如海拔随纬度递变或污染浓度随距离源递减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"idw-反距离加权\">IDW 反距离加权</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def idw_interpolation(known_coords, known_values, target_coord, power=2):&#10;    distances = np.sqrt(np.sum((known_coords - target_coord)**2, axis=1))&#10;    if np.any(distances == 0):&#10;        return known_values[distances == 0][0]&#10;    weights = 1.0 / distances**power&#10;    return np.sum(weights * known_values) / np.sum(weights)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idw_interpolation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(known_coords, known_values, target_coord, power</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    distances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(np.sum((known_coords </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_coord)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.any(distances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> known_values[distances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">power</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sum(weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> known_values) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sum(weights)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>IDW 的幂参数控制距离衰减的速度：幂值越大，近邻点的影响越强，结果越局部化；幂值越小，远处点的影响越大，结果越平滑。幂值为 0 时退化为简单均值（所有点权重相等），幂值趋向无穷时退化为最近邻插值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>IDW</th>\n<th>普通克里金</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>理论基础</td>\n<td>几何距离</td>\n<td>空间自相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>克里金方差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数估计</td>\n<td>幂参数</td>\n<td>变异函数拟合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外推能力</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测偏差</td>\n<td>趋向均值</td>\n<td>最优无偏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"交叉验证与精度评估\">交叉验证与精度评估</h2><p>空间插值结果的精度评估通常采用留一交叉验证（LOOCV）：依次移除每个采样点，用剩余点进行插值预测，然后比较预测值与实际值。常用评价指标包括均方根误差（RMSE）、平均绝对误差（MAE）和决定系数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。对于克里金，还需检查标准化预测误差的均值是否接近 0、方差是否接近 1——偏离说明变异函数模型不恰当。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>克里金是基于变异函数的最优线性无偏估计方法，同时提供预测值和不确定性</li>\n<li>变异函数分析是克里金的前提，需要识别块金效应、偏基台和变程三个关键参数</li>\n<li>块金效应反映微尺度变异和测量误差，变程决定空间自相关的有效范围</li>\n<li>IDW 简单高效但缺乏统计理论支撑，适合快速估算；克里金适合需要不确定性评估的场景</li>\n<li>变异函数模型选择（球面/指数/高斯）应基于实验变异函数的形态和交叉验证结果</li>\n<li>留一交叉验证是空间插值精度评估的标准方法</li>\n<li>大数据量场景下可使用局部克里金或降采样策略缓解 O(n³) 的计算瓶颈</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"克里金与空间插值","id":"克里金与空间插值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"变异函数分析","id":"变异函数分析"},{"level":2,"text":"普通克里金","id":"普通克里金"},{"level":2,"text":"IDW 反距离加权","id":"idw-反距离加权"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉验证与精度评估","id":"交叉验证与精度评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"点模式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/point-pattern-analysis"},"next":{"title":"地理空间回归模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/geospatial-data-analysis/spatial-statistics/geospatial-regression"}}